{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You want to endlessly roll dice and battle folklore monsters? We got you covered.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll magical dice, collect rare loot, nudge your fate in the right direction, slay folklore creatures and finally face the King of Undead, The Lich!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/b6ae71847c79690f90d7f81779ceb1e2.poster.avif?t=1761065343\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/b6ae71847c79690f90d7f81779ceb1e2.webm?t=1761065343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Die for the Lich, we set out to recreate the magic of playing a unique deck-builder for the first time.<br>We replaced cards with dice that you need to pair with your gear and the game took on a life of its own, a curious blend of strategy, chaos, and pushing your luck! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/46e8aba0e4f6363dca77fd8003cfb99f.poster.avif?t=1761065343\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/46e8aba0e4f6363dca77fd8003cfb99f.webm?t=1761065343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you strike the perfect balance between dice, weapons, abilities and trinkets?<br>Do you wish to always roll what you need, then find a Lucky Die.<br>Do you need custom made dice, then visit the Dice Fusion table.<br>Do you want to re-roll 1s, then grab the Eye Patch ability.<br>Do you think you are strong enough for a tougher battle, then seek the Blood Moon.<br>The options are endless and there is nothing more exciting than having your own unique journey in a chaotic world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415570?t=1761065343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/6ee22cf4daba71dc70418f5f5f200ab98d08fce1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761065343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/19f6784e556f644249479e99ae347737a59134ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761065343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/19f6784e556f644249479e99ae347737a59134ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761065343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3639920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You want to endlessly roll dice and battle folklore monsters? We got you covered.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll magical dice, collect rare loot, nudge your fate in the right direction, slay folklore creatures and finally face the King of Undead, The Lich!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/b6ae71847c79690f90d7f81779ceb1e2.poster.avif?t=1761065343\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/b6ae71847c79690f90d7f81779ceb1e2.webm?t=1761065343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Die for the Lich, we set out to recreate the magic of playing a unique deck-builder for the first time.<br>We replaced cards with dice that you need to pair with your gear and the game took on a life of its own, a curious blend of strategy, chaos, and pushing your luck! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/46e8aba0e4f6363dca77fd8003cfb99f.poster.avif?t=1761065343\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/46e8aba0e4f6363dca77fd8003cfb99f.webm?t=1761065343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you strike the perfect balance between dice, weapons, abilities and trinkets?<br>Do you wish to always roll what you need, then find a Lucky Die.<br>Do you need custom made dice, then visit the Dice Fusion table.<br>Do you want to re-roll 1s, then grab the Eye Patch ability.<br>Do you think you are strong enough for a tougher battle, then seek the Blood Moon.<br>The options are endless and there is nothing more exciting than having your own unique journey in a chaotic world.</p>","developers":["Monovoid"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/c2b0a56b4cbf0eb15ec5474bcedc3b99e28ed6a4/header.jpg?t=1761065343","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415570/545165375/88236bd7927e508c9b44b8be2df1589a5a942c0e/1753210876/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753214295","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415570/